Hello,

Long and short of it is that my Caldigit TB4 dock is not working properly
with my modern linux desktop setup that has thunderbolt enabled by
installing a PCIE card. It's able to drive two 1440p displays fine, but USB
is not functioning at all. USB does work with another machine so I'm sure
it's not the dock.

I have done a lot of investigation over the last two nights, and I figured
that y'all would be the people to send the results to (though there is a
terribly large amount of stuff I'm sending)

Attached are reports generated immediately after boot on various kernels
and a writeup of what I've done to try and work around the issue.

Best,
Ben

